# Cursor Rules for EMDC Website

## Build Verification
- After making any code changes (especially TypeScript files), always run `npm run build` to verify the build succeeds
- If build errors occur, fix them before completing the task
- This ensures TypeScript type checking and compilation errors are caught immediately

## Project Structure
- All readme files under readme folder
- CMS Project with separation of concerns admin and public
- All Data files are json location in folder data
- All data files locations are in constants data-paths
- Put all tests in tests directory

## Admin Structure
- For admin all css to be in admin/public/css/custom.css and all js to be in admin/public/js/custom.js

## Public Site Structure
- For public site: all scripts must be in public/js and it should be compiled into script.js using node build-script.js

## Architecture
- Follow the MVC patterns: all business in service, all presentation in controllers and all design and presentation in views






